	&lt;li data-imagepartheight="95.08196721311475" data-imagepartleft="49.18032786885246" data-imageparttop="321.06555876184683" data-imagepartwidth="167.21311475409837" dir="auto"&gt;ναγγο βαγο μαρο φοϸτιιηδο οδο-&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-imagepartheight="85.24590163934425" data-imagepartleft="65.57377049180327" data-imageparttop="412.8688374503714" data-imagepartwidth="111.4754098360656" dir="auto"&gt;μο οιλιργο σαριγο φοϸτιιο σιδο ο-&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-imagepartheight="118.03278688524591" data-imagepartleft="78.68852459016394" data-imageparttop="481.72129646676484" data-imagepartwidth="209.8360655737705" dir="auto"&gt;ρβαγγο κιρανο οδασο ι χαρο πορ-&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-imagepartheight="91.80327868852464" data-imagepartleft="78.68852459016394" data-imageparttop="586.6393292536501" data-imagepartwidth="203.27868852459017" dir="auto"&gt;δανιγο οδο γονζο οδο ροτιγο μαρο&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-imagepartheight="111.47540983606552" data-imagepartleft="81.9672131147541" data-imageparttop="658.7704767946337" data-imagepartwidth="177.0491803278689" dir="auto"&gt;φοϸτιιο οδαβαχρηγο αʹ Δραχμο&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-imagepartheight="95.08196721311481" data-imagepartleft="124.59016393442623" data-imageparttop="763.6885095815189" data-imagepartwidth="206.55737704918033" dir="auto"&gt;τ̣ωζο οδο αʹ Δραχμο καραφσο&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-imagepartheight="85.24590163934431" data-imagepartleft="140.98360655737704" data-imageparttop="852.2130997454534" data-imagepartwidth="131.14754098360655" dir="auto"&gt;ταδο πακασο χιρανο οδομο μισο&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-imagepartheight="114.75409836065569" data-imagepartleft="140.98360655737704" data-imageparttop="927.6229358110272" data-imagepartwidth="173.7704918032787" dir="auto"&gt;σαγισο αστο μαλο ταδδηιο ταρο&lt;/li&gt;
